### 💻 三、 具体测试用例与代码示例

#### 1. 场景 A：库存预扣减（并发安全测试）

**测试目标**：验证 `InventoryService` 在多线程环境下不会出现超卖，且库存扣减准确。

```java
// 文件: src/test/java/com/erp/inventory/InventoryServiceTest.java

@SpringBootTest
public class InventoryServiceTest {

    @Autowired
    private InventoryRepository inventoryRepo;

    @Autowired
    private InventoryService inventoryService;

    private final String SKU_CODE = "SKU_ERP_001";

    @BeforeEach
    void setUp() {
        // 准备数据：初始库存 100 件
        inventoryRepo.deleteAll();
        inventoryRepo.save(new Inventory(SKU_CODE, 100, 0));
    }

    /**
     * 测试用例：并发扣减库存_必须不超卖
     * Given: 初始库存 100
     * When: 50 个线程同时扣减 3 件（总需求 150）
     * Then: 库存应剩余 1 件（只成功扣减 33 次，共 99 件），无负库存
     */
    @Test
    @DisplayName("并发扣减库存_必须不超卖")
    void concurrentDeduction_shouldNotOversell() throws InterruptedException {
        int threadCount = 50;
        int deductQty = 3;

        CountDownLatch latch = new CountDownLatch(threadCount);
        ExecutorService executor = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(threadCount);

        AtomicInteger successCount = new AtomicInteger(0);
        AtomicInteger failCount = new AtomicInteger(0);

        for (int i = 0; i < threadCount; i++) {
            executor.execute(() -> {
                try {
                    boolean result = inventoryService.deductStock(SKU_CODE, deductQty);
                    if (result) {
                        successCount.incrementAndGet();
                    } else {
                        failCount.incrementAndGet();
                    }
                } finally {
                    latch.countDown();
                }
            });
        }

        latch.await(5, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
        executor.shutdown();

        // 验证结果
        Inventory finalStock = inventoryRepo.findBySkuCode(SKU_CODE);

        // 断言1：最终库存不为负
        assertThat(finalStock.getAvailableQty()).isGreaterThanOrEqualTo(0);

        // 断言2：成功次数 * 扣减量 + 剩余量 = 初始量
        int totalDeducted = successCount.get() * deductQty;
        assertThat(finalStock.getAvailableQty() + totalDeducted).isEqualTo(100);

        // 断言3：必然有部分失败（因为需求 150 > 库存 100）
        assertThat(failCount.get()).isGreaterThan(0);

        System.out.println("成功次数: " + successCount.get() + ", 剩余库存: " + finalStock.getAvailableQty());
    }
}
```

**TDD 引导提示**：
*   如果此测试失败（如出现负库存），说明实现代码使用了“先查后改”模式。
*   **修正方向**：请使用 SQL 原子更新：`UPDATE inventory SET qty = qty - ? WHERE sku = ? AND qty >= ?`。

